 "description": "Ciliberto2005 - Steady states and oscillations in the p53/Mdm2 network\nBioModels BIOMD0000001006 (curated). SBML file: Ciliberto2005.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 1200 time units (SED-ML: Ciliberto2005.sedml), sampling 1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 3.74e-06 of species peak (worst: Mdm2_p_nuc)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] species 'IR' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'p53' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] species 'MDM2_total' is defined by an assignment rule; not a Kintecus state (not output)\n  [info] DNA_Repair: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] p53_ubiquitination_1 term 3/3: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - p53_ub: zero order, signed\n  [info] p53_total_degradation_2: rate order differs from the stoichiometry; consumed on separate line(s) - p53_total: zero order, signed\n  [info] time event(s) on 'step' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_STEP.TXT (SET)\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): p_step = step",
